WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.160
[Silly accent] Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.880
Sonic Suggests

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.620
The game where you...

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.880
...I-I honestly have no id- Oh...

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.360
OH...

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.440
[Electronic music]

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:15.220
[Markiplier giggles]

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.280
[Laughing] Oh no...

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:18.420
Oh-

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.100
Eggman: Sonic. How I hate him...

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.920
Eggman: BURN!

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.380
[Music distorts and fades]

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.580
[Zapping sound]

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.740
[Funky victory music]

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.060
[Music fades out]

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.860
[Ambient noise/music]

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.850
Oh-- Oh no, am I--

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.240
[Mark laughs]

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.720
I'm falling! We're falling!!

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.940
WE'RE STILL FALLING--

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.580
Oh.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.120
I guess we're okay then.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.340
Oh, is this just-- Wait, how do I--

00:00:53.900 --> 00:01:00.500
Do I have any camera controls? Do I- Is there just no point to having...? I don't have any camera controls do I?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.800
In-game narration: Grove Street, Home. At least it was till I fucked everything up.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.260
Excuse me? [Laughs]

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.620
[Slightly distressed] I have no idea what's happening.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.180
Can I actually hit thi-- Oh, okay...

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.320
Can I hit this... thing?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.820
All right, so that works.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:22.280
How do I turn the camera? How do I in any way shape or form, turn the--

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.160
Oh, I don't. Okay, I don't.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:25.860
Ah...

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.200
Oh...

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:28.940
Oh...!

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.320
Oh, it's beautiful!

00:01:33.299 --> 00:01:35.299
Oh, It's so cinematic!

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.340
Oh it's so beautiful!

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.180
Somehow I doubt that. Somehow, I really doubt...

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:43.460
This is a Hideo Kojima game. I really-- [Chuckles]

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.800
A sequel to Sonic Forces.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.160
Ah.
[Upbeat action music starts playing]

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.279
Okay, I get it.

00:01:49.279 --> 00:01:50.840
Tails: Sonic, help me!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:55.220
Oh, all right, sure. Oh no...

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:57.080
[Laughs in disbelief] What--

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.560
Oh, hey, let go of Tails there.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:02.560
What's weird about this game Is it seems to be taking itself seriously?

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:07.160
But not? But-- I mean, it's like... It's not taking yourself seriously

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:11.280
but also it's like, better made than just a Garbo Sonic game?

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.500
Whoo combo.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.340
Hello.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:16.060
So-- Tails, can you get that one for me? Thank you.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.540
[Laughs] I guess we'll uh-- Oh...

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.640
Tails, thank you for getting in my way there.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:28.220
Tails get out of my WAY! Tails! This is my special-- TAILS! This is my special mo--

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.180
There we go-- TAILS.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.280
God, damn it. This son of a-

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.440
Alright, whatever, we're just gonna keep going this way.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.780
Tails wants to ruin my day and I can't experience the fun and joy that I WANTED to get out of this game--

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.640
Oh my god.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:46.700
Ah-- Oh, a big one! See, the thing is like I - I honestly have no complaints about the game at this point.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:51.720
I really don't! I have no complaints, none at all. This is actually pretty well made!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.840
The music's a little grating but...

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.100
Knuckles: Sonic is alive!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.189
Am I? Knuckles, is that you??

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.880
I don't exactly know what happened to me, but I'm gonna assume that--

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:05.200
All right. Anyway, see ya. See you around the bend, buddy.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.560
I WAS-- oookay. All right.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:12.560
You can't just-- What is that spin move? Oh, it's doing-- Knuckles come back-- Knuckles, why are you a dog?

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:21.220
Knuckles, why are you walking on all four-- Wait, did you get-- Wha? Whooho... Oh, you're better now... I guess.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.590
Ooohh...

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.560
Okay...

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:24.560
Oh no...

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.220
All right, well, come along... Come along now.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:32.560
Whoa... What happens if I do this?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.480
OHH!!!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:42.700
Oh, it's death, alriiight. I'm so confused. [Laughs]

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.460
Okay, so don't touch the mega spr- spring, go to the boss.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:50.140
ALL RIGHT BOSS, I'm coming for you wherever you are, it's gonna be you and me...

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:53.080
You and me facing off to the end of days-- Is that you Eggman?!

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.800
HUH EGG BOY?! Oh get back here...
Eggman: (No way, I can't believe this!)

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:02.000
Yeah, I can't believe it either. How did that plan of yours not work. How - how am I supposed to-- Oh!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:06.320
Eggman: ALL SYSTEMS FULL POWER!
Mark: ...Wow... Okay.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.440
Eggnan: Hmph! Not bad!
Mark: Oh--

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.040
Eggman: Hmph! THIS IS ONLY THE BEGINNING!!!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.840
[Mark giggles]

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.240
Alright okay alright Eggman.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.640
Can I - can I please catch up to you Eggman??

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:19.760
Eggboy!

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.280
Eggman: Don't get too excited boys!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.860
I wasn't getting too excited to be perfectly honest

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.580
in fact, I was getting kind of concerned about the...

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.020
The whole reality of this existence because it was kind of messed up even before!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.510
Even before you tripped me with the - the power

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.560
[Eggman's machine explodes]

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:36.580
[Comedically over-dramatic music]

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.520
[Laughing] Oh my god!

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.500
[Mark makes noises halfway between laughter and cries of distress]

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:52.060
Oh, kick him while he's down, okay. Oh, good job. Good job, everybody. Good job.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:54.060
Oooohhh...

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.260
So he's dead and you just throw him into the river?

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.160
[Bubbly sound effect as Eggman sinks]

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.520
Oh no...
[Music fades out]

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:05.940
[Funky victory music from opening]

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:09.300
[Loud pop]

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.040
Oh?

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:14.560
"When everything you know has come and gone."
[Distorted theme of Infinite - Sonic Forces plays]

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.660
"When everything you know has come and gone."
(You are at your lowest, I am rising higher)

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:21.460
"Only scars remain of who I was."

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.460
"Only scars remain of who I was."
(What we’ll find in ashes, you lose in the fire)

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:28.340
"When there’s no one left to carry on."

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.480
"When there’s no one left to carry on."
(This is an illusion, open up your eyes and...)

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.040
"This pain"
(Persists)

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.080
"I can't"
(Resist)

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:38.200
"But that’s what it takes to be Infinite."

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:39.720
[Sound of being zapped out of existence]
[Music stops]

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.020
[Windows notification sound]

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.200
Oh, Java update!

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.940
[Mark wheezes]

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:57.160
[Laughing] Wait, wait was that in the game? The Java update, was that in the game?!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:01.380
I think that was-- I think they programmed that in because it faded out at the exact same time.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.460
I'm positive that was...

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:05.700
[Mark laughs]

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.520
I'm positive that was part of it

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.260
Okay, all right, wow that was...

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:14.120
That was a thing of beauty. That was honestly a thing of beauty. That was...

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.540
Wow, that was a goddamn delight.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.260
[Noise of relief]

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:20.380
[Sigh]

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.540
No, you have to remember this. For the end of your days

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:25.969
you have to remember that. You have to live with the knowledge that you...

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.600
Saw that.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:36.180
[Previous rock music returns, just as loudly and suddenly]

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.600
[Music begins to 'glitch']

